  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1412.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1412.01 Applicability. This part shall apply to all plans for restoration of a waterfront buffer or natural woodland buffer that are submitted to the department for approval.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1400) #12062 eff 12-17-16",
